<title>POLAND: Bank Slaski Q4 net rises to PLN 63,1 mln.</title>
<headline>Bank Slaski Q4 net rises to PLN 63,1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Slaski results for the fourth quarter ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q4 1996     Q4 1995</p>
<p>    operating profit			 82.05 vs   99.55</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   82.03 vs  100.10</p>
<p>    net profit				 63.10 vs   21.63</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Slaski SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	     0.0   vs    0.30</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    353.04  vs  365.19</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	 229.43  vs  173.99</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    58.82  vs    53.59</p>
<p>    costs of commission		    2.45  vs     3.00</p>
<p>    income tax				18.91  vs    78.47</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.02  vs     0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		     0.01  vs    0.56(profit)</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p>    operating profit		     445.59  vs   421.83</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			 445.66  vs   422.18</p>
<p>    net profit			     305.96  vs   257.85</p>
